 :itonami.blueprint/implemented-slice
 "LeatherTanningAdvisor ⊣ Leather Tanning Plant Operations Governor,
 langgraph-clj StateGraph, append-only audit ledger. A tannery
 OPERATIONS COORDINATION actor for leather-tanning plant operations
 (chrome/vegetable tanning drums, finishing-line equipment,
 effluent-treatment concerns) -- not direct tanning/finishing-line-
 equipment operation or effluent-discharge authorization authority.
 Four ops (`:log-production-batch` / `:schedule-maintenance` /
 `:flag-safety-concern` / `:coordinate-shipment`), all `:effect
 :propose` only. Ten concrete governor checks elaborate this
 blueprint's HARD invariants: propose-only effect, closed op
 allowlist, closed proposal-effect allowlist (no direct
 tanning/finishing-line-equipment control), permanent
 effluent-discharge-authorization block, independent
 equipment verification/registration before maintenance scheduling,
 independent batch verification/registration before shipment
 coordination, independent shipment-area recompute against the
 batch's own logged output area, double-schedule guard, leather-grade
 validation, and shrinkage-temperature (hydrothermal stability)
 plausibility validation. Safety-concern flagging (chemical hazard --
 chromium VI / effluent-discharge concern / worker safety) ALWAYS
 escalates to a human tannery supervisor; `:log-production-batch` is
 the only op eligible to auto-commit, and only at phase 3 when
 governor-clean."}
